$string['landingfield_publicdescription'] = 'Public description';
$string['landingfield_publicdescription_desc'] = 'One or two sentences about the course for people outside the platform: this is the text a messaging app or social network shows under the link when the enrolment landing page of a public course is shared. Written for an outside audience, reviewed as such, and never replaced by the course summary. Leave it empty and the shared link shows only the course name.';
$string['landingfield_shareimage'] = 'Share picture';
$string['landingfield_shareimage_desc'] = 'The picture a messaging app or social network shows under the link when the enrolment landing page of a public course is shared, the pair of the public description. A landscape photo, JPEG or PNG, at least 1200 by 630 pixels: it is cropped from its centre to that shape, so keep what matters in the middle. Never shown on the platform. Leave it empty and the shared link shows the course image; a vector file (SVG) is not used, and the course image stands in for it too.';
