$string['logocompactdark'] = 'Compact logo for dark surfaces';
$string['logocompactdark_desc'] = 'A version of Boost Union\'s compact logo for dark surfaces: a dark navbar (this theme\'s navy one included), the panel and the band of this theme\'s login page, and the side menu in dark mode. Keep the proportions of the light file: it is drawn in that file\'s box. Without Boost Union\'s compact logo nothing changes and this file is not used. The compact logo of a Boost Union flavour is never replaced.';
